{"author":{"affiliation_history":[{"country_code":"US","id":"I97018004","name":"Stanford University","years":[2023,2024,2025,2026]},{"country_code":"KR","id":"I193775966","name":"Yonsei University","years":[2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026]},{"country_code":"KR","id":"I89015989","name":"Dankook University","years":[2024]},{"country_code":"US","id":"I161318765","name":"University of California, Los Angeles","years":[2024]},{"country_code":"KR","id":"I4210160791","name":"Yonsei University Health System","years":[2018,2020,2024]}],"author_id":"A5103067735","ca_plastic_works_count":2,"ca_works_count":2,"citations_by_year":[{"all":0,"plastic":0,"year":2017},{"all":22,"plastic":0,"year":2018},{"all":87,"plastic":0,"year":2019},{"all":117,"plastic":0,"year":2020},{"all":169,"plastic":0,"year":2021},{"all":200,"plastic":0,"year":2022},{"all":300,"plastic":2,"year":2023},{"all":386,"plastic":21,"year":2024},{"all":395,"plastic":30,"year":2025},{"all":331,"plastic":30,"year":2026}],"cited_by_count":2009,"current_in_ca":true,"domain_tags":[],"early_career":true,"first_pub_year":2017,"first_year":2023,"h_index":27,"institution_ids":["I193775966","I97018004"],"last_ca_year":2026,"last_year":2024,"m_quotient":3.0,"name":"Sungsoon Kim","orcid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5464-6048","plastic_basis":"openalex","plastic_citations":83,"plastic_works_count":2,"primary_affiliations":[{"country_code":"KR","id":"I193775966","name":"Yonsei University","source":"openalex_last_known"},{"country_code":"US","id":"I97018004","name":"Stanford University","source":"openalex_last_known"}],"rising_pct":77,"rising_score":0.0079,"work_count":2,"work_ids":["W4384498830","W4390968717"]},"schema_version":"s3.1","works":[{"abstract":"There remains continued interest in improving the advanced water oxidation process [e.g., ultraviolet (UV)/hydrogen peroxide (H 2 O 2 )] for more efficient and environmentally friendly wastewater treatment. Here, we report the design, fabrication, and performance of graphene oxide (GO, on top)/nickel-doped iron oxyhydroxide (Ni:FeOOH, shell)/silicon nanowires (SiNWs, core) as a new multifunctional photocatalyst for the degradation of common pollutants like polystyrene and methylene blue through enhancing the hydroxyl radical (\u2022OH) production rate of the UV/H 2 O 2 system. The photocatalyst combines the advantages of a large surface area and light absorption characteristics of SiNWs with heterogeneous photo-Fenton active Ni:FeOOH and photocatalytically active/charge separator GO. In addition, the built-in electric field of GO/Ni:FeOOH/SiNWs facilitates the charge separation of electrons to GO and holes to Ni:FeOOH, thus boosting the photocatalytic performance. Our photocatalyst increases the \u2022OH yield by 5.7 times compared with that of a blank H 2 O 2 solution sample and also extends the light absorption spectrum to include visible light irradiation.","author_count":9,"author_ids":["A5005523364","A5006272263","A5027400685","A5033839627","A5062547932","A5063671472","A5086940573","A5103067735","A5110843507"],"author_institution_ids":["I97018004"],"authors":[{"id":"A5110843507","name":"Rui Ning"},{"id":"A5103067735","name":"Sungsoon Kim"},{"id":"A5062547932","name":"Eddie Sun"},{"id":"A5006272263","name":"Yue Jiang"},{"id":"A5033839627","name":"Jihyun Baek"},{"id":"A5005523364","name":"Yuzhe Li"},{"id":"A5086940573","name":"Ashley M. Robinson"},{"id":"A5027400685","name":"Lauren J. Vallez"},{"id":"A5063671472","name":"Xiaolin Zheng"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":true,"cited_by_count":19,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.3c00696","domain_tags":["fate_transport_and_sorption","wastewater_and_treatment"],"facet_tags":["matrix:wastewater"],"institution_ids":["I97018004"],"is_oa":false,"journal":"Nano Letters","last_updated":"2026-11-07T11:25:07.637180","license":"","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"closed","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.3c00696","openalex_topics":["T10024","T10078","T10210